#: babybuddy/templates/babybuddy/import.html:41
msgid ""
"Entries are added as new records. File IDs and child columns are ignored; "
"the selected child is used. Imported history does not reduce current diaper "
"stock."
msgstr ""
"Уписи се додају као нови записи. Идентификатори датотеке и дечје колоне се "
"игноришу; изабрано дете се користи. Увозне историје не смањује актуелне "
"залихе пелена."

# Offline machine-assisted draft; contextual review, not certified
# translation.
#: babybuddy/templates/babybuddy/import.html:42
msgid ""
"Choose the units used in the numeric columns. Baby Buddy exports use kg, cm,"
" mL, and °C."
